---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import DownloadSelector from "../../components/DownloadSelector.astro";
import { getPreviewChannel } from "../../lib/release-channel";

/* The title, description and integrity copy below used to promise per-artifact
   SHA-256 and cleanroom records unconditionally. With no published release the
   body correctly says nothing is available, so the page advertised evidence for
   artifacts that do not exist — in the two strings a search engine indexes and a
   social preview shows, which are also the first thing a reader sees.

   Reading the same channel the selector reads keeps the promise and the artifact
   from disagreeing. */
const channel = await getPreviewChannel();
const published = channel?.targets.some((target) => target.status === "available") ?? false;
/* One manifest covers the whole release, so the first artifact that names one is
   the link for every target. */
const checksumUrl =
  channel?.targets.flatMap((target) => target.artifacts).find((artifact) => artifact.checksumUrl)?.checksumUrl ?? null;
---
<BaseLayout
  title={published ? "下载 BootAgent — 技术预览版" : "下载 BootAgent — 尚未公开发行"}
  description={published
    ? "下载 BootAgent 技术预览版：macOS 版已签名并经 Apple 公证，产物经 GitHub Releases 分发并附校验清单。"
    : "BootAgent 尚未公开发行。发行后这里会列出各平台的安装包。"}
>
  <header class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell page-hero-grid">
      <div>
        <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="面包屑"><a href="">首页</a> / 下载</nav>
        <h1 class="page-title">{published ? "下载 BootAgent" : "还没有可下载的产物。"}</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="page-hero-aside">
        <strong>无需 BootAgent 账号</strong>
        {published
          ? "安装包由官方发行流构建，macOS 版已签名并经 Apple 公证；校验值随发行公布。"
          : "发行之后，这里会列出各平台的安装包与它们的校验清单入口。"}
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>
  <section class="section-compact">
    <div class="shell"><DownloadSelector /></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section-muted">
    <div class="narrow prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">发行完整性</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">每个渠道分发的都是同一个官方构建。</h2>
      <p>产物由 GitHub Releases 发行，校验清单随每次发行一同公布。</p>
      <p>渠道不追加推广文件，不替换安装脚本，不二次签名。</p>
      {/* Linking the published manifest rather than printing digests here: the
          reader checks against the release itself, not against a number this
          page could have got wrong — and the page stays free of hex. */}
      {checksumUrl && (
        <p>需要校验时，对照发行流发布的<a href={checksumUrl} rel="noopener">校验清单</a>；算出的值不一致就不要运行，并把文件名与下载地址发到支持页面。</p>
      )}
      <h3>当前是技术预览版</h3>
      <p>macOS 版自 v0.7.0 起带 Developer ID 签名并通过 Apple 公证，首次打开不再被 Gatekeeper 拦截。Windows 的 Authenticode 签名还没完成，SmartScreen 会提示一次；签名与验证门禁齐备后，每个平台各自进入 Stable。</p>
      {/* The four-step Gatekeeper bypass came down with v0.7.0, as its own copy
          promised it would. The link stays for readers still holding a v0.6.x
          download: the guide now tells them to upgrade rather than teaching an
          allowance no current build needs. */}
      <p>还在运行 v0.6.x 或更早的历史预览版？那些包未签名，macOS 会拦截首次打开——<a href="quickstart/#macos-gatekeeper">macOS 首次打开说明</a>解释了原因，以及为什么现在直接升级比放行旧版更好。</p>
      <p>BootAgent 不会让你关闭 Gatekeeper、执行 <code>spctl --master-disable</code> 或降低系统整体安全设置。</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
